  <!-- 6. RM_Stonewater — ice-boned brake, deep floor. Water-as-mineral: its
       skeleton is ice because ice is the local granite. RULED (Q3): the ice
       is a real harvest item, a generic cooking/hydration input
       (RM_StonewaterIce) — AND a powered extractor placed on a brake
       (RM_ChillStonewaterExtractor, RM_TheChillFuelChain.xml) melts it into
