       energy economy. No harvest — pasture layer. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBaseNonEdible">
    <defName>RM_Skyharp</defName>
    <label>skyharp</label>
    <description>No sun has ever reached this floor and none ever will; the only light income is the aurora, and the skyharp is strung for it. A fan of vertical filaments rises off the shallow floor like the instrument it is named for, each string a different length and a different chemistry, each tuned — genuinely, physically tuned — to one of the aurora's emission lines: the long strings drink the green, the short ones the violet, and a skyharp under a full reconnection storm lights up string by string as the sky runs through its registers. It is photosynthesis rebuilt for a black sky by way of an antenna array.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Plant/RM_Skyharp/RM_Skyharp</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.2</drawSize>
